* Beta 11.0: New card: Brain Shift. EPIC Spell. SOUL: Perseverance. COST 6. EFFECT: Deal a monster under KR's ATK as DMG to your opponent and remove the KR.
* Beta 13.1: EFFECT UPDATE: Deal a monster without Can't attack under KR's ATK as DMG to your opponent and remove the KR. 
** This nerf was implemented to prevent Brain Shift from being used with [[Chara/Previous Versions|Chara]] which had Can't attack and 99 ATK.
** ''Can't attack'' is now known as ''Disarmed''.  
* Beta 18.0: EFFECT UPDATE: Deal a monster under KR's ATK as DMG to your opponent and remove the KR.
* Beta 18.1: COST 6 > 5.
* Beta 20.2: EFFECT UPDATE: Deal a monster under KR's ATK as DMG to your enemy (max: 10) and remove the KR.
** This nerf was also implemented to prevent Brain Shift from being used with Chara.
* Beta 38.0: EFFECT UPDATE: Deal a monster under KR's ATK to your opponent and remove the KR (max 8 DMG).
* Beta 43.0: EFFECT UPDATE: Force an enemy monster to attack another random enemy monster.
** Brain Shift received an updated sprite.
* Beta 62.1: EFFECT UPDATE: Both players draw a card. Force an enemy monster to attack another random enemy monster.
* Beta 65.1: EFFECT UPDATE: Force an enemy monster to attack another random enemy monster. If one dies, silence its killer.
* Beta 72.0: COST 5 > 4.
* Beta 84.0: Brain Shift has been replaced by [[Aftermath]].
